  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Socialh&#xF6;gskolan bedriver ett Sida-finansierat arbete i Litauen (Social Safety Project).Efter en revision av socialh&#xF6;gskolan 1997 riktades kraftig kritik mot skolans interna redovisning. Pga av denna kritik har Sida beslutat att genom revisionsbyr&#xE5;n Ernst &amp; Young g&#xF6;ra en granskning av fakturorna f&#xF6;r projektet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The School of Social Studies is carrying out a Social Safety Project in Lithuania supported by Sida. An audit made in 1997 of the internal accounts of the school showed relevant shortcomings, and this is why Sida decided to carry out an audit of the project through the accountant firm Ernest &amp; Young.</narrative>
  </description>
